    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5]\ntheorem erdos_741.variants.lower : answer(sorry) ↔ ∀ A : Set ℕ, 0 < lowerDensity (A + A) → ∃ A₁ A₂,\n    A = A₁ ∪ A₂ ∧ Disjoint A₁ A₂ ∧ 0 < lowerDensity (A₁ + A₁)\n    ∧ 0 < lowerDensity (A₂ + A₂)",
